@startuml Graceful_Shutdown
title DoIP Server - Graceful Shutdown

<style>
sequenceDiagram {
    LineType ortho
    MessageAlign center
    ResponseMessageBelowArrow true
    ParticipantPadding 40
}
</style>

participant "OS" as OS
participant "main" as Main
participant "Server" as Server
participant "Sessions" as Sess

== Running ==

Main -> Server: start()

note over Server
    TCP and UDP services
    running concurrently
end note

== Shutdown ==

OS -> Main: SIGINT (Ctrl+C)

Main --> Server: server future dropped

note over Server
    TCP listener dropped (stops accepting)
    UDP socket dropped (stops receiving)
end note

Main --> Sess: runtime exits

note over Sess
    all tasks cancelled
    session resources released automatically
end note

@enduml